{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Infinite Hotel, a physical afterlife that worships ancient artists from the 20th-22nd century, has been awarded greatest expression due to its creator's suicide.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As cosmic artists converge to destroy it, you play as Violet, a witch looking for her brother at the edge of the world, not knowing her entire planet is on top of a hotel building.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique RPG epic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Giant interconnected areas to explore.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hundreds of learnable skills from 10 weapon types and 21 elements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hundreds of different monsters to peacefully kill with violence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over a thousand weapons and armor that anyone can equip.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Massive talent tree to further customize your town and team.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic combat psychology.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Golem.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ghost Ship.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Card Game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New Game+.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Super Dungeon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Super Bosses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple difficulties.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No max level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And of course, you unironically saying murda for the rest of your life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Originally released in the summer of 2016, Wooden Ocean has received consistent updates for the last 9 years, more than tripling its original size and story. These updates will continue long after it's tripled again.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/684000?t=1766705602","ba